    ELENA @ sad "少数几个知道我秘密的人，根本没空搭理我这样的人。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AWomansTouch/scr_Awomanstouch0.rpy:42
translate zh scr_WomansTouch_primer_b8092dba:

